        "original_id": "a6f3405b-0463-5620-9bac-96be0d1beb88",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip Chan, Ricky Lau, Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung, Joey Wong, Joey Wang, Wang Tsu Hsien, Joey Ong Jyo Han/Hen, Chor Yuen, Leslie Cheung, Anita Mui, Cecilia Yip\n- Films: Where's Officer Tuba?, Look Out, Officer!, Last Song in Paris\n- Places: Hong Kong, Taiwan\n- Topics: Hong Kong action comedy films, Hong Kong romance films, actors, directors\n\nFacts:\n- Joey Wong Cho-Yee, also known as Joey Wang, Wang Tsu Hsien, and Joey Ong Jyo Han or Hen, was born on January 31, 1967.\n- Joey Wong is a Taiwanese-born actress based in Hong Kong.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? is a 1986 Hong Kong action comedy film directed by Philip Chan and Ricky Lau.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? stars Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung, and Joey Wong.\n- Last Song in Paris is a 1986 Hong Kong romance film written and directed by Chor Yuen.\n- Last Song in Paris stars Leslie Cheung, Anita Mui, Joey Wong, and Cecilia Yip.\n- Look Out, Officer! starred Sammo Hung.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
